      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, that makes much more sense. thank you. i'm still a bit paranoid though—it feels like we're trusting this one person or company with a huge amount of money. what's to stop them from just being shady or greedy with it? like, what kind of actual oversight or regulations are in place to make sure they don't just keep the interest for themselves or mishandle the funds?",
